abstract: >
  Analysis code for independent verification of the dose calibration
  coefficient in passive-scattering proton therapy using prompt-gamma
  flux monitoring and machine-learning methods.

  Analysis codes associated with the study on error testing of the
  secondary-radiation monitoring system in ocular proton therapy,
  within the context of passive-scattering proton therapy.

